& [EstablishedSeam]
  + the 2026-07-29 llama_tool_reflection experiment proves an unmodified llama-server can emit one exact tool call receive a deterministic host result and import it during a second checkpoint
  + Slice10 proves a real rmcp client can register inspect and validate through one volatile subprocess and preserve exact Slice7 output
  + the two seams have not yet been joined in one experiment

